# Multicast captures from tools/record_streams.py. Real ones are worth keeping,
# but deliberately, not by accident -- a night of packets is a large file.
# The site-prefixed form (e.g. greenhill-capture.jsonl) is how --out names them
# in practice, so ignore that too, not just the bare and dotted names.
capture.jsonl
*.capture.jsonl
*-capture.jsonl
.DS_Store
